# RIMSHIRE: water drowns any disk that can't swim, however it gets there;
# swimmers (the ooze, the toadkin) float.
game rimshire
cheat war 1
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat army 0 F
cheat army 1 SO
cheat battle 6 1 0
cheat field 0
cheat pond 30 0 18 32
cheat place 0 100 128
cheat place 1 200 128
cheat place 2 300 40
waituntil bphase == 1 200
press A
hold RIGHT 40
hold A 48
expect pips == 4
wait 1
waituntil moving == 0 800
expect d1_on == 0
expect water_deaths == 1
expect d2_on == 1
expect cell_35_5 == 3
